Stop a running turn, or close what is waiting without running it

Usage: mxr assistant stop [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
